hadiths[19]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1318","[AI-translation] Umar bin Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ham waasris na banaatey hain, jo ham ne chhoda wo sadqa hai. Aur wo maal-e-fai mein se jo Allah ne Aap ko diya apne ghar walon par unkey saal bhar ka kharcha kharch kartey. Phir jo baaqi bachta use Allah key maal ki jagah rakhtey. Phir Aap ne us se farmaya jo sahaaba mein haazir they: Main tumhey Allah ka waasta deta hun jiskey izn se aasmaan aur zameen qaem hain, kya tum wo jaantey ho? Unhon-ne kaha: Haan. Aur majlis mein Usmaan aur Abdur Rahman bin Auf aur Zubair aur Saad bin Abi Waqqaas they. Aur Ali aur Abbas ki hadees aur un donon key jhagdey ka zikr kya. Aur use laana hamaari shart mein nahi hai. (Bukhari: 3094)"
"1319","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne apne sahaaba ki taraf do puraney jootey nikaaley jinkey do tas mey they. To bayan kya ke wo donon Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key jootey hain. (Bukhari: 3107)"
"1320","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne gudhda hua kambal nikaala aur kaha: Is mein Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki rooh qabz ki gai. (Bukhari: 3108)"
"1321","[AI-translation] Aur aik riwayat mein hai ke Aisha ne hamaari taraf mota tehband nikaala jo Yaman mein banaaya jaata hai aur kambal un mein se jinhey wo gudhey huey kehtey hain. (Bukhari: 3108)"
"1322","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka pyaala toot gaya. To daraar ki jagah chaandi ki zanjeer banaai gai. (Bukhari: 3109)"
"1323","[AI-translation] Jaabir bin Abdullah Ansaari (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham mein se aik aadmi key haan ladka paida hua aur us ne uska naam Qaasim rakkha. To Ansaar ne kaha: Ham tumhey Abul Qaasim kunniyat na dengey aur na tumhey aankh thandi karengey. To wo Nabi key paas aaya aur tumhey aankh thandi na karengey. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ansaar ne achha kya. Merey naam par naam rakkho aur meri kunniyat par kunniyat na rakkho. Beshak main Qaasim hun. (Bukhari: 3115)"
"1324","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main tumhey deta hun aur na rokta hun. Beshak main Qaasim hun, jahaan mujhey hukm diya gaya rakhhta hun. (Bukhari: 3117)"
"1325","[AI-translation] Khaula Ansaariya (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Beshak aadmi Allah key maal mein naahaq dakh and aazi kartey hain. To unkey liye Qiyaamat key din aag hai. (Bukhari: 3118)"
"1326","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Nabiyon mein se Nabi ne ghazwa kya. To apni qaum se farmaya: Merey peechey wo aadmi na chaley jis ne aurat ka mehr apna kya ho jabke wo us se nikaah karna chaahta ho aur us ne nikaah na kya ho. Aur na koi jis ne ghar banaaey hon aur unki chhatein unchi na kein hon. Aur na koi jis ne bakriyaan ya haamla oontniyaan khareedi hon jabke wo unkey jan-ney ka intezaar karta ho. To us ne ghazwa kya aur basti key qareeb Asr ki namaz key waqt ya uskey qareeb pahuncha. To us ne sooraj se kaha: Beshak tu hukm diya gaya hai aur main hukm diya gaya hun. Ae Allah! Use ham par rok dey. To wo rok diya gaya yahan tak ke Allah ne us par fatah di. To us ne maal-e-ganeemat jama kya. To aag aai, yaani use khaaney key liye, aur us ne use na khaaya. To us ne kaha: Beshak tum mein khayaanat hai. To har qabeelay mein se aadmi meri baiat karey. To aadmi ka haath uskey haath se chipak gaya. To us ne kaha: Tum mein khayaanat hai. To tumhaara qabeela meri baiat karey. To do ya teen aadmiyon key haath uskey haath se chipak gaey. To us ne kaha: Tum mein khayaanat hai. To wo gaey ka sar jaisa soney ka sar ley kar aey aur use rakkha. To aag aai aur use khaa gai. Phir Allah ne hamaarey liye maal-e-ganeemat halaal kar diye. Us ne hamaari kamzori aur aajizi dekhi aur unhey hamaarey liye halaal kar diya. (Bukhari: 3124)"
"1327","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne lashkar bheja jabke Aap us mein Najd ki taraf they. To unhey bahut oont ganeemat mein milay. To unkey hissey baarah oont ya gyaarah oont huey aur unhey aik aik oont izaafi diya gaya. (Bukhari: 3134)"
"1328","[AI-translation] Jaabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Jabke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Jiraana mein ganeemat taqseem kar rahey they ke Aap se aik aadmi ne kaha: Insaaf karo. To Aap ne us se farmaya: Beshak main badnaseeb hua agar main ne insaaf na kya. (Bukhari: 3138)"
"1329","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ko Hunain key qaidiyon mein se do londiyaan milein. To unhey Makkah key baaz gharon mein rakkha. Unhon-ne kaha: To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Hunain key qaidiyon par ehsaan kya. To wo galiyon mein daudney lagey. To Umar ne kaha: Ae Abdullah! Dekho ye kya hai? To us ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne qaidiyon par ehsaan kya hai. Unhon-ne kaha: Jao aur donon londiyaan bhej do. (Bukhari: 3144)"
"1330","[AI-translation] Abdur Rahman bin Auf (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Jabke main Badr key din saf mein khada tha ke main ne apne daaen aur baaen dekha. Phir main Ansaar key do ladkon key darmiyaan tha jinki umrein kam thein. To main ne tamanna ki ke main un donon se zyada taaqat walon key darmiyaan hota. To un mein se aik ne mujhey ishaara kya aur kaha: Ae chacha! Kya tum Abu Jahl ko pehchaantey ho? Main ne kaha: Haan, ae merey bhatijay tumhey us se kya kaam hai? Us ne kaha: Mujhey khabar di gai hai ke wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko gaali deta hai. Qasam us zaat ki jiskey haath mein meri jaan hai! Agar main use dekhun to mera saaya uskey saayey se juda na hoga yahan tak ke ham mein jaldi marney wala mar jaey. To main ne us par taajjub kya. To doosrey ne mujhey ishaara kya aur mujh se us jaisa kaha. To main ne der na ki ke main ne Abu Jahl ko logon mein phirta hua dekha. Main ne kaha: Khabardaar! Beshak ye tum donon ka saathi hai jiskey baarey mein tum ne mujh se poochha tha. To wo donon apni talwaaron key sath uski taraf dauday aur use maara yahan tak ke use qatl kar diya. Phir wo donon Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf wapas aey aur Aap ko khabar di. To Aap ne farmaya: Tum mein se kis ne use qatl kya? Un mein se har aik ne kaha: Main ne use qatl kya. To Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum ne apni talwaarein ponchhein? Unhon-ne kaha: Nahi. To Aap ne donon talwaaron mein dekha. To farmaya: Tum donon ne use qatl kya hai. Uska saamaan Muaz bin Amr bin Jamuh key liye hai. Aur wo Muaz bin Afra aur Muaz bin Amr bin Jamuh they. (Bukhari: 3141)"
"1331","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak main Quraish ko deta hun taake unhey maanoos karun kyunke wo jaahiliyat se naya ahd rakhtay hain. (Bukhari: 3146)"
"1332","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Ansaar mein se logon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha jab Allah ne apne Rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko Hawaazin key maalon mein se maal-e-fai diya tha jo diya tha. To Aap Quraish mein se aadmiyon ko sau sau oont denay lagey. To unhon-ne kaha: Allah Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko maaf farmaaey, Quraish ko detey hain aur hamein chhorey huey hain jabke hamaari talwaarein unkey khoon se tapak rahi hain. Anas ne kaha: To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko unki baat ki khabar di gai. To Aap ne Ansaar ki taraf bheja aur unhey chamdey key khe mey mein jama kya aur unkey sath unkey siwa kisi ko na bulaaya. Phir jab wo jama ho gaey to unkey paas Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tashreef laaey. To Aap ne farmaya: Kya baat thi jo mujhey tumhaarey baarey mein pahunchi? To unkey samajhdaaron ne Aap se kaha: Hamaarey raey walon mein se Ya Rasulullah kisi ne kuchh nahi kaha. (Bukhari: 3147)"
"1333","[AI-translation] Jubair bin Mutim (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke wo jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath they jabke Aap key sath log Hunain se wapas aatey huey they ke dehaatiyon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko gher liya jo Aap se maangtey they yahan tak ke unhon-ne Aap ko keekar key darkht ki taraf majboor kar diya aur us ne Aapki chaadar kheench li. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khadey huey aur farmaya: Mujhey meri chaadar do. Phir agar in keekaron key baraabar maweshi hotey to main unhey tumharey darmiyaan taqseem karta. Phir tum mujhey bakheel aur na jhootha aur na buzdil paaogey. (Bukhari: 3148)"
"1334","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath chal raha tha jabke Aap par Najraan ki motey haashiye wali chaadar thi. To dehaati Aap tak pahuncha aur Aap ko zor se kheench liya yahan tak ke main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key kandhey key pehlu ko dekha ke us par chaadar key haashiye ne uskey zor se kheenchney ki wajah se nishaan daal diya tha. Phir us ne kaha: Merey liye Allah key maal mein se hukm do jo tumharey paas hai. To Aap uski taraf mutawajjeh huey aur hansay. Phir uskey liye ataa ka hukm diya. (Bukhari: 3149)"
"1335","[AI-translation] Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Jab Hunain ka din tha to Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne taqseem mein logon ko tarjeeh di. To Aqra bin Haabis ko sau oont diye. Aur Uyaina ko us jaisa diya. Aur Arbon key sardaaron mein se logon ko diya. To unhey us din taqseem mein tarjeeh di. Aik aadmi ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Beshak ye taqseem hai jis mein insaaf nahi kya gaya aur jis mein Allah ka chehra nahi chaaha gaya. To main ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Main zaroor Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko khabar dunga. To main Aap key paas aaya aur Aap ko khabar di. To Aap ne farmaya: Phir kaun insaaf karega agar Allah aur uska Rasool insaaf na karein. Allah Musa par rehem farmaaey, unhey us se zyada takleef di gai thi aur unhon-ne sabr kya tha. (Bukhari: 3150)"
"1336","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham apne ghazwaat mein shehed aur angoor paatey they. To use khaatey aur use (taqseem key liye) na uthaatey. (Bukhari: 3154). Jizya aur sulah ki kitaab."
